# Android package routing for FlClash (and later other Android clients).
#
# Format: group,package,label
# Groups:
#   北美  -> select group (US/PayPal-style exit)
#   游戏  -> select group (JP/game exit)
#   绕过  -> DIRECT on backcn; omitted on cnip except the VPN client itself
#
# Source: docs/nekobox-route-snapshot.json (vivo NekoBox route page).
# First group wins if a package appears twice. YouTube and T-Life are 北美-only
# because that rule was above 绕过app on the phone.

# 北美app -> Dmit-Beanfield-Paypal
北美,com.chase.sig.android,Chase
北美,com.citi.citimobile,Citi Mobile
北美,com.discoverfinancial.mobile,Discover
北美,com.experian.android,Experian
北美,com.tmobile.tuesdays,T-Life
北美,com.usbank.mobilebanking,U.S. Bank
北美,com.google.android.youtube,YouTube

# 游戏 -> JPTY1-Game
游戏,com.miHoYo.Yuanshen,原神

# 绕过app -> DIRECT. YouTube / T-Life omitted (北美 already claimed them).
# Snapshot reported 31 apps / 30 visible; the missing package is still unverified.
